<title>USA: Union Camp names William Hamill CFO.</title>
<headline>Union Camp names William Hamill CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Camp Corp said Monday it named A. William Hamill chief financial officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>He replaces James Reed, who will retire at the end of 1997 when he will become 65, the company's normal retirement age. Until his retirement, Reed continues as vice chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Hamill was previously the company's  senior vice president of finance.</p>
<p>Union Camp makes paper, packaging, chemicals and wood products.</p>
